{
  "conclusion": "Through 500 ms the steady supervisor state stays NORMAL. The supervisor has no signal-freshness or staleness check: a steady stream of late intent and sensor packets is stamped on receipt. A check of packet age is a required Layer 2 item and is not implemented in this layer.",
  "delay_model": "Each step draws a delay uniformly from 0 to the sweep value. The intent sample and the noisy sensor sample from that earlier time are what enter the controller and the safety supervisor. The supervisor stamps them on receipt. Torque is not delayed again after approval. The same draw is paired across conditions. The fixed two-step simulation-loop queue is not added on top.",
